/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This project presents a hybrid search engine that combines Term Frequency-Inverse Document Frequency \(TF-IDF\) with Bidirectional Encoder Representations from Transformers \(BERT\) to improve document retrieval precision. The goal is to overcome the limitations of keyword-based search \(like TF-IDF\) by adding semantic understanding through BERT. TF-IDF is used for fast, lexical filtering of documents based on keyword overlap, while BERT computes deep semantic embeddings to accurately rank the most relevant documents. This two-stage pipeline ensures both efficiency and semantic accuracy. The system is particularly useful for academic, legal, and recommendation domains where contextual understanding is vital.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
