/E (In the era of digital information overload, retrieving the most relevant document quickly and accurately has become a major challenge across industries like academia, law, healthcare, and e-commerce. As the number of documents grows exponentially, traditional keyword-based search methods fall short in understanding the true intent behind user queries.)
/Pg 15 0 R
