/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This project proposes a hybrid document search system that combines the strengths of both TF-IDF and BERT. The system first uses TF-IDF to filter and shortlist a set of documents that are likely relevant based on keyword similarity. BERT is then applied to this smaller set to compute semantic embeddings and rank documents based on their contextual similarity to the query. This two-step approach offers a balance between speed and semantic accuracy.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
