/E (The dataset used in this project comprises a curated collection of text documents in various formats, including PDFs and plain text files. These documents span multiple domains such as education, law, technology, and general articles, representing a realistic corpus for evaluating semantic search systems. The dataset was assembled from publicly available resources and internal academic content. Each file serves as an individual document and contains unstructured text of varying lengths, styles, and complexity. The goal of this dataset is to simulate real-world document retrieval challenges, where documents may use different terminologies or phrasing to convey similar information.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
