270 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We began by training a TfidfVectorizer on the full corpus of cleaned document text. This vectorizer transforms each document into a sparse numerical representation, where each dimension corresponds to a unique word weighted by its importance. For a given input query, TF-IDF scores are computed using cosine similarity, allowing us to efficiently shortlist a subset of the most lexically similar documents.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
