282 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The evaluation confirms that our hybrid model offers significant performance improvements for real-world document search tasks. By narrowing the candidate set using TF-IDF and applying BERT selectively, we achieve a practical trade-off between speed and semantic depth.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [17]
>>
