303 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (For the BERT-based ranking stage, feature importance is distributed across the 768-dimensional contextual embedding generated for each document and query. Although individual embedding dimensions are not easily interpretable, we used cosine similarity to measure the alignment between the query vector and document vectors. To analyze this semantically, we examined the text spans that contributed most to the BERT similarity scores.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
