<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 474 0 R
/E ( Currently, BERT embeddings are computed on-the-fly for filtered documents. To reduce latency in large-scale deployments, we can precompute and cache document embeddings. Integration with vector indexing tools like FAISS or Annoy would enable high-speed similarity search, making the system more suitable for real-time environments.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
