320 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 476 0 R
/E ( Building an interactive web-based interface would allow end users to query the system more intuitively. A front-end portal integrated with a backend API could support features like query autosuggestions, semantic filters, and result summarization for better usability.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
