/S /P
/P 477 0 R
/E (Result Summarization and Snippet Highlighting)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
322 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 478 0 R
/E ( To further improve the user experience, implementing a summarization module could generate concise previews of the most relevant sections in each document. Highlighting matching phrases from both TF-IDF and BERT perspectives would help users understand why a result was returned.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [9]
>>
